00:30:44,010 --> 00:30:52,270
Presentation video: Actually, before po, nung wala pa pong DICT po, yung ginagawa po ng mga tao po dito, pumupunta pa po sila sa taas ng hundok po.

209
00:30:52,530 --> 00:30:59,390
Presentation video: Without centralized services, agencies would need to make independent investments in hardware, which is quite expensive.

