Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: the committee hearing on the fiscal year

6093
04:28:04,550 --> 04:28:05,550
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 2027

6094
04:28:05,550 --> 04:28:06,550
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: budget of the

6095
04:28:06,550 --> 04:28:12,970
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Department of Information and Communications Technology,

6096
04:28:13,830 --> 04:28:15,610
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: including its attached agencies,

6097
04:28:16,070 --> 04:28:18,830
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: under House Bill No. 10858,

6098
04:28:19,550 --> 04:28:22,110
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I move to terminate the proceedings this afternoon.

6099
04:28:22,270 --> 04:28:23,230
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So moved, Mr. Chairman.

6100
04:28:23,230 --> 04:28:24,510
Committee member/seconding voice: Second, Mr. Chair.

6101
04:28:25,250 --> 04:28:28,490
Rep. Brian Poe: It has been moved and duly seconded

6102
04:28:28,490 --> 04:28:30,750
Rep. Brian Poe: to terminate the hearing on the proposed

6103
04:28:30,750 --> 04:28:34,010
Rep. Brian Poe: fiscal year 2027 budget of the Department

6104
04:28:34,010 --> 04:28:36,450
Rep. Brian Poe: of Information and Communication Technology

6105
04:28:36,450 --> 04:28:38,650
Rep. Brian Poe: including its attached agency.

6106
04:28:39,270 --> 04:28:40,470
Rep. Brian Poe: Is there any objection?

6107
04:28:41,330 --> 04:28:42,590
Rep. Brian Poe: The chair hears none.

6108
