Rep. Brian Poe: The motion is approved.

6109
04:28:44,910 --> 04:28:45,590
Rep. Brian Poe: Congratulations.

6110
04:28:50,670 --> 04:28:53,790
Rep. Brian Poe: So thank you, Your Honors,

6111
04:28:54,010 --> 04:28:56,030
Rep. Brian Poe: and our colleagues from the Department of Information

6112
04:28:56,030 --> 04:28:57,270
Rep. Brian Poe: and Communication Technology

6113
04:28:57,270 --> 04:28:59,170
Rep. Brian Poe: for your valuable participation.

6114
04:29:00,130 --> 04:29:02,050
Rep. Brian Poe: We likewise thank the members of the committee

6115
04:29:02,050 --> 04:29:03,910
Rep. Brian Poe: for their active participation.

6116
04:29:04,550 --> 04:29:06,010
Rep. Brian Poe: Maraming maraming salamat po.

6117
04:29:06,450 --> 04:29:08,550
Rep. Brian Poe: The proceedings are hereby suspended

6118
04:29:08,550 --> 04:29:10,670
Rep. Brian Poe: and will resume at 5.45

